    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n- Identify the element that seems broken on the sample page.\r\n- Think about what you expected to happen when you clicked the button.\r\n- Note what actually happened (or didn't happen) when you clicked it.\r\n- Pinpoint the exact location on the page where the issue occurs.\r\n- Combine these three details to form a clear bug report.",
